#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:14
msgctxt "country"
msgid "Lao PDR"
msgstr "老挝人民民主共和国"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:5
msgctxt "description"
msgid "A health worker registers him offline and records the cards as \"reported, not yet verified\"."
msgstr "一名卫生工作者在离线状态下为他登记，并将卡片记录为“已报告，尚未验证”。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:313
msgctxt "references.label"
msgid "User scenario in the IG"
msgstr "实施指南（IG）中的用户场景"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:308
msgctxt "scene.label"
msgid "CHW phone: registered, reported"
msgstr "CHW 手机：已登记，已报告"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:300
msgctxt "scene.label"
msgid "Home visit, Village 04"
msgstr "家访，Village 04"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:129
msgctxt "scene.label"
msgid "No signal"
msgstr "没有信号"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:152
msgctxt "step.enabler"
msgid "An offline form links the baby to his household immediately; it syncs once the phone finds a signal."
msgstr "离线表单立即将婴儿关联到其家庭；手机一旦有信号便会同步。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:42
msgctxt "step.enabler"
msgid "The phone reads the card offline, and keeps “what the family told us” clearly separate from “what we have verified”."
msgstr "手机离线读取卡片，并将“家人告诉我们的”与“我们已验证的”明确区分开。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:128
msgctxt "step.experiences.doing"
msgid "Adds Somsack to the Sengmany household, saves the two doses as unverified and books a clinic referral."
msgstr "将 Somsack 加入 Sengmany 家庭，把两剂次保存为未验证，并预约诊所转诊。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:140
msgctxt "step.experiences.doing"
msgid "Confirms household details as head of household."
msgstr "以户主身份确认家庭信息。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:134
msgctxt "step.experiences.doing"
msgid "Is added to his household: the Lao health system now knows he exists."
msgstr "被加入他的家庭：老挝卫生系统现在知道他的存在了。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:146
msgctxt "step.experiences.doing"
msgid "Receives a referral to the District Health Center."
msgstr "收到前往区卫生中心的转诊。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:36
msgctxt "step.experiences.doing"
msgid "Scans both QR cards and reads the doses, without checking their signatures."
msgstr "扫描两张 QR 码卡片并读取剂次，但不核查其签名。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:30
msgctxt "step.experiences.doing"
msgid "Tells Vilay about the birth in Thailand and shows the cards."
msgstr "向 Vilay 讲述在泰国分娩的经过，并出示卡片。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:147
msgctxt "step.experiences.feeling"
msgid "“Another trip — but at least they know about his vaccines now.”"
msgstr "“又要跑一趟——不过至少他们现在知道他打过哪些疫苗了。”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:141
msgctxt "step.experiences.feeling"
msgid "“Good, he’s on our family record now.”"
msgstr "“很好，他现在在我们的家庭记录里了。”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:37
msgctxt "step.experiences.feeling"
msgid "“I can read it, but I can’t prove it’s real out here.”"
msgstr "“我能读出来，但在这里我证明不了它是真的。”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:31
msgctxt "step.experiences.feeling"
msgid "“I hope we’re not in trouble for giving birth abroad.”"
msgstr "“希望我们不会因为在国外生孩子而惹上麻烦。”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:129
msgctxt "step.experiences.feeling"
msgid "“No signal for weeks — but I need to register him today.”"
msgstr "“几周都没有信号——但我今天就得给他登记。”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:135
msgctxt "step.experiences.feeling"
msgid "“Three weeks old, and now he counts.”"
msgstr "“三周大了，现在他才算数。”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:255
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.change"
msgid "Created as primarySource = false"
msgstr "创建时 primarySource = false"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:220
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.change"
msgid "Created with a temporary Lao ID"
msgstr "使用老挝临时 ID 创建"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:267
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.change"
msgid "Referral to District Health Center"
msgstr "转诊至区卫生中心"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:232
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.change"
msgid "Somsack added as member"
msgstr "Somsack 被添加为成员"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:243
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.change"
msgid "The registration form, answered offline (SDC)"
msgstr "离线填写的登记表（SDC）"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:233
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.why"
msgid "CHW work is organised by household: the roster is how a missing newborn is noticed."
msgstr "CHW 的工作按家庭组织：通过家庭成员名册才能发现漏登的新生儿。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:221
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.why"
msgid "He is not in the Lao civil registry yet; a temporary id lets the CHW, clinic and portal all mean the same child. Thailand only gave him a hospital number."
msgstr "他尚未进入老挝民事登记系统；临时 id 让 CHW、诊所和门户指向同一个孩子。泰国只给了他一个医院编号。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:256
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.why"
msgid "Read without checking the signature, so kept as reported: not lost, but not counted by the schedule yet."
msgstr "读取时未核查签名，因此保留为“已报告”：不会丢失，但暂不计入接种计划。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:244
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.why"
msgid "The form is configuration, not code; keeping the answers lets every extracted record trace back to what was asked."
msgstr "表单是配置，而不是代码；保留答案可以让每一条提取出的记录都能追溯到当时所提的问题。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:268
msgctxt "step.fhirChanges.why"
msgid "The phone cannot verify a DVC but the clinic can; the referral points at exactly the doses to check."
msgstr "手机无法验证 DVC，但诊所可以；转诊单准确指明需要核查的剂次。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:51
msgctxt "step.handoff.carrier"
msgid "Camera scan"
msgstr "相机扫描"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:161
msgctxt "step.handoff.carrier"
msgid "Offline form (FHIR Questionnaire), then sync via Info Gateway"
msgstr "离线表单（FHIR Questionnaire），随后通过 Info Gateway 同步"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:52
msgctxt "step.handoff.payload"
msgid "Decoded dose data (not yet saved)"
msgstr "已解码的剂次数据（尚未保存）"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:162
msgctxt "step.handoff.payload"
msgid "Patient + Group + unverified Immunization ×2 + referral"
msgstr "Patient + Group + 未验证的 Immunization ×2 + 转诊"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:160
msgctxt "step.handoff.summary"
msgid "Referral to the District Health Center"
msgstr "转诊至区卫生中心"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:50
msgctxt "step.handoff.summary"
msgid "The doses, read but not checked, go into the registration"
msgstr "已读取但未核查的剂次进入登记"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:21
msgctxt "step.headline"
msgid "On a routine village visit, Vilay finds a newborn the Lao system doesn’t know exists. She can read the vaccines on his cards, but she can’t prove they are genuine."
msgstr "在一次例行的村庄家访中，Vilay 发现了一个老挝系统并不知道其存在的新生儿。她能读出他卡片上的疫苗，却无法证明它们是真的。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:119
msgctxt "step.headline"
msgid "With no signal, Vilay adds Somsack to his household, saves his doses as “reported”, and refers the family to the clinic."
msgstr "在没有信号的情况下，Vilay 将 Somsack 加入他的家庭，把他的剂次保存为“已报告”，并将这家人转诊到诊所。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:99
#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:99
msgctxt "step.illustration.alt"
msgid "In a Lao village with no signal, Vilay, the community health worker, scans the paper cards with her phone while Khamla holds Somsack and Bounmy looks on"
msgstr "在一个没有信号的老挝村庄，社区卫生工作者 Vilay 用手机扫描纸质卡片，Khamla 抱着 Somsack，Bounmy 在一旁看着"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:25
msgctxt "step.narrative"
msgid ""
"On a routine visit to Village 04, Vilay finds a newborn the Lao\n"
"system does not know exists. Her phone has had no signal for weeks. Khamla\n"
"shows the two cards. The CHW app reads them with **read-unverified**\n"
"(STT-VER-011; STT-B45-002, STT-ZIP-002, STT-CBR-003), which needs no trust\n"
"list. It shows the doses, but checks no signature and saves nothing yet.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一次对 Village 04 的例行访视中，Vilay 发现了一个老挝系统并不知道其存在的新生儿。她的手机已经几周没有信号了。Khamla 出示了两张卡片。CHW 应用以 **read-unverified**（STT-VER-011；STT-B45-002、STT-ZIP-002、STT-CBR-003）读取它们，这无需信任列表。应用显示剂次，但不核查任何签名，也暂不保存任何内容。\n"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:123
msgctxt "step.narrative"
msgid ""
"On the CHW app's newborn form (structured data capture,\n"
"`TrustDemoHouseholdRegistration`) she adds Somsack to the Sengmany household\n"
"(`TrustDemoHousehold`), with a temporary id. Bounmy confirms the details as\n"
"head of household. The app saves the doses read from the cards as reported by\n"
"the family, not verified (`TrustDemoJ2HepBReported`, `TrustDemoJ2BcgReported`:\n"
"`primarySource` false). Vilay refers Somsack to the district health center\n"
"(`TrustDemoJ2Referral`). Everything stays queued on the phone, for 28 days if\n"
"need be, and syncs when it next reaches a signal.\n"
msgstr ""
"在 CHW 应用的新生儿表单（结构化数据采集，`TrustDemoHouseholdRegistration`）中，她使用临时 id 将 Somsack 加入 Sengmany 家庭（`TrustDemoHousehold`）。Bounmy 以户主身份确认这些信息。应用将从卡片读取的剂次保存为由家人报告、未经验证（`TrustDemoJ2HepBReported`、`TrustDemoJ2BcgReported`：`primarySource` 为 false）。Vilay 将 Somsack 转诊至区卫生中心（`TrustDemoJ2Referral`）。所有内容都在手机上排队，必要时可保留 28 天，并在下次有信号时同步。\n"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:151
msgctxt "step.painPoint"
msgid "Babies born abroad are invisible to the home health system until civil registration catches up — sometimes months later."
msgstr "在境外出生的婴儿在民事登记跟上之前，对本国卫生系统而言是不可见的——有时要等上几个月。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:41
msgctxt "step.painPoint"
msgid "Without a check, a forged or mistyped card could quietly become an official record."
msgstr "如果不加核查，一张伪造或录错的卡片可能会悄无声息地变成正式记录。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:43
msgctxt "step.policy"
msgid "Keep a clear line between what families report and what has been verified, and don’t grant trust too early."
msgstr "在家人报告的内容与已验证的内容之间划清界限，不要过早给予信任。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:153
msgctxt "step.policy"
msgid "Newborns can be registered at home, offline, before civil registration or a national ID exists."
msgstr "新生儿可以在本国离线登记，无需等待民事登记或国民身份证。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:156
msgctxt "step.record.description"
msgid "Baby registered; 2 doses saved as “reported by family”"
msgstr "婴儿已登记；2 剂次保存为“由家人报告”"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:46
msgctxt "step.record.description"
msgid "Doses read from the 2 cards; nothing saved yet"
msgstr "已从 2 张卡片读取剂次；尚未保存任何内容"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:157
msgctxt "step.record.heldWhere"
msgid "CHW phone (waiting to sync)"
msgstr "CHW 手机（等待同步）"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:47
msgctxt "step.record.heldWhere"
msgid "Paper cards + CHW phone"
msgstr "纸质卡片 + CHW 手机"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:76
msgctxt "step.technicalSummary"
msgid "The phone can read the QR but deliberately doesn’t trust it: it decodes the card offline and checks no signature. Nothing is written yet."
msgstr "手机能读取 QR 码，但有意不信任它：它离线解码卡片，不核查任何签名。尚未写入任何内容。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:187
msgctxt "step.technicalSummary"
msgid "The registration form is a FHIR Questionnaire. Its answers become standard FHIR resources on the phone; the doses read from the cards are saved with primarySource=false, apart from verified data, and everything syncs whenever there is signal."
msgstr "登记表是一个 FHIR Questionnaire。其答案在手机上转为标准 FHIR 资源；从卡片读取的剂次以 primarySource=false 保存，与已验证数据分开，所有内容在有信号时同步。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:20
msgctxt "step.title"
msgid "A health worker finds the baby — and reads his cards"
msgstr "一名卫生工作者找到了婴儿——并读取了他的卡片"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:118
msgctxt "step.title"
msgid "Registered at home, and referred"
msgstr "在家中登记并转诊"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:122
msgctxt "step.touchpoint"
msgid "Offline phone app (household form + referral)"
msgstr "离线手机应用（家庭表单 + 转诊）"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:24
msgctxt "step.touchpoint"
msgid "Offline phone app (QR scan)"
msgstr "离线手机应用（QR 码扫描）"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:80
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "Decodes the QR offline"
msgstr "离线解码 QR 码"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:203
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "On sync, checks the CHW’s token and only lets her write to households in her own catchment"
msgstr "同步时检查 CHW 的令牌，只允许她写入其自身服务片区内的家庭"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:199
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "Patient and Group (household); Immunization.primarySource = false; ServiceRequest for referral"
msgstr "Patient 和 Group（家庭）；Immunization.primarySource = false；用于转诊的 ServiceRequest"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:88
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "PreQual codes read, but not yet mapped to the Lao schedule"
msgstr "已读取 PreQual 代码，但尚未映射到老挝接种计划"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:84
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "QR decoded (CBOR) but signature not checked"
msgstr "QR 码已解码（CBOR），但未核查签名"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:195
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "Renders the household registration form and extracts FHIR from the answers"
msgstr "呈现家庭登记表，并从答案中提取 FHIR"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:191
msgctxt "step.uses.role"
msgid "Stores data on the phone; works 28+ days offline"
msgstr "在手机上存储数据；可离线工作 28 天以上"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:170
msgctxt "step.whatIf.outcome"
msgid "Everything stays queued safely on the device and syncs when she next reaches the health center."
msgstr "所有内容都安全地在设备上排队，并在她下次到达卫生中心时同步。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:60
msgctxt "step.whatIf.outcome"
msgid "Technically possible with a cached trust list — but who keeps it current on thousands of village phones?"
msgstr "借助缓存的信任列表，技术上可行——但谁来让成千上万部村庄手机上的列表保持最新？"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:169
msgctxt "step.whatIf.scenario"
msgid "Vilay’s phone stays offline for 28 days."
msgstr "Vilay 的手机连续 28 天离线。"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:59
msgctxt "step.whatIf.scenario"
msgid "What if the CHW phone could verify signatures offline too?"
msgstr "如果 CHW 手机也能离线验证签名呢？"

#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:22
#: scenarios/user-scenarios/j2-found-at-home.json:22
msgctxt "step.when"
msgid "T0 + 3 weeks"
msgstr "T0 + 3 周"

